flowchart LR
  BRAIN[KZ-Brain] --> REG[Tool registry]
  REG --> DISC[Capability discovery]
  DISC --> PERM[Permission layer]
  PERM -->|approved| EXEC[Isolated execution]
  PERM -->|sensitive| HUMAN[Human approval]
  HUMAN --> EXEC
  EXEC --> VAL[Result validation]
  VAL --> OBS[Observability and audit]
  VAL -->|reject / retry bounded| ERR[Controlled failure]
